"""
Physician reference library (English + Arabic).
Each topic becomes its own page: ref/<slug>.html and ar/ref/<slug>.html.
Edit text here, then run:  python3 build.py

Text pairs are written as (English, Arabic).
A table cell can be a plain string (same in both languages) or a pair.

Fields
  slug      page address
  group     section on the index page (see GROUPS)
  title     {en, ar}
  lead      one-line summary {en, ar}
  key       "Key points" box: list of pairs
  sections  list of {h: pair, p: [pairs], ul: [pairs], table: {head: [cells], rows: [[cells]]}, note: pair}
  see       related slugs
  src       source keys (SOURCES here, or learn.SOURCES)
"""

